},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":113,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xinyang-q-d75ddbe0acc6a4e758e7","section":"chapter-025","block":"b-c3968b6056c5dd2efce4","layer":"original","quote":"太祖封讨超之功，侯者十一人，赐阜爵关内侯。阜让曰：“阜，君存无捍难之功〖13〗，君亡无死节之效〖14〗；于义当黜，于法当诛。超又不死，无宜苟荷爵禄。”","section_title":"辛毗杨阜高堂隆传第二十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0056.xhtml","index":151,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":75,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xinyang-q-d85a43d9e1dd1fddaa66","section":"chapter-025","block":"b-f268bd9ca6512e638cf6","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞臣松之以为：忠至之道，以亡己为理；是以匡救其恶，不为身计。而阜表云“使国亡而臣可以独存，臣又不言也”，此则发愤为己，岂为国哉！斯言也，岂不伤谠烈之义，为一表之病乎？","attribution":"裴注·裴松之评论","section_title":"辛毗杨阜高堂隆传第二十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0056.xhtml","index":281,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-f7d3c58b8ef40d7d8ba5","start":0,"end":85,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
